<title>SPAIN: Telefonica debt financing cost down 7.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Telefonica debt financing cost down 7.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish telecommunications group Telefonica said on Monday its debt financing costs dropped 7.7 percent at the end of the first quarter versus one-year ago, amid declines in interest rates.</p>
<p>&quot;It is worth noting a 7.7 percent decline in financial costs on debt, falling to 44.05 billion pesetas in part due to the decline of Spanish interest rates,&quot; Telefonica said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
